--- a/vllm/models/deepseek_v4_1/tilelang/lookback.py
+++ b/vllm/models/deepseek_v4_1/tilelang/lookback.py
@@ -5,7 +5,10 @@
 Each row of ``lookback`` ([rows, depth], int32) holds the ids of the ``depth``
